{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"819","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Mister B and Beacons on Field"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mister B has a house in the middle of a giant plain field, which attracted aliens life. For convenience, aliens specified the Cartesian coordinate system on the field in such a way that Mister B's house has coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":". After that they sent three beacons to the field, but something went wrong. One beacon was completely destroyed, while the other two landed in positions with coordinates "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(m, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0, n)"},{"kind":"text","text":", respectively, but shut down."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Mister B was interested in this devices, so he decided to take them home. He came to the first beacon, placed at "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(m, 0)"},{"kind":"text","text":", lifted it up and carried the beacon home choosing the shortest path. After that he came to the other beacon, placed at "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(0, n)"},{"kind":"text","text":", and also carried it home choosing the shortest path. When first beacon was lifted up, the navigation system of the beacons was activated."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Partially destroyed navigation system started to work in following way."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At time moments when both survived beacons are at points with integer coordinates the system tries to find a location for the third beacon. It succeeds if and only if there is a point with integer coordinates such that the area of the triangle formed by the two survived beacons and this point is equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":". In this case the system sends a packet of information with beacon positions to aliens, otherwise it doesn't."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Compute how many packets of information system sent while Mister B was moving the beacons."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ t ≤ 1000"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the number of test cases. The next "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"3·t"},{"kind":"text","text":" lines describe "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" test cases. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Every test case is described in three lines as follows. "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that each parameter is given as a product of three factors."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of a test case contains three space-separated integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n3"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ni ≤ 106"},{"kind":"text","text":") such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n = n1·n2·n3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains three space-separated integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m3"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ mi ≤ 106"},{"kind":"text","text":") such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m = m1·m2·m3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains three space-separated integers: "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s2"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s3"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ si ≤ 106"},{"kind":"text","text":") such that "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s = s1·s2·s3"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note that for hacks only tests with "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t = 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" allowed."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers one per line — the answers for each test."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n2 1 1\n2 1 1\n1 1 3\n1 5 1\n2 2 1\n1 1 2\n10 6 18\n2 103 2\n13 1 13\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"ki